{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505940/extras/82286fe5e5aa4df92a6557cb622cc483.poster.avif?t=1762966791\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505940/extras/82286fe5e5aa4df92a6557cb622cc483.webm?t=1762966791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505940/extras/82286fe5e5aa4df92a6557cb622cc483.mp4?t=1762966791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Hatchling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locked in a dystopian lab, a strange egg stirs.</strong> Its <strong>temperature, humidity, and nutrients</strong> must be maintained with precision. Its <strong>integrity is fragile</strong>. And you <strong>must not fail</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Overseer watches</strong>\u2014cold, unwavering, and <strong>silent in its judgment</strong>. You are but one of many caretakers before you, each evaluated, each replaced. <strong>Failure is not an option.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Game of Dread and Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>low-bit horror simulation</strong> demands <strong>absolute efficiency</strong>:  <br>\u2714 <strong>Regulate temperature, humidity, and nutrients</strong>\u2014maintain the egg\u2019s <strong>delicate balance</strong>.  <br>\u2714 <strong>Acquire and ration lab supplies</strong> through the <strong>Supply Shaft</strong>\u2014resources are limited.  <br>\u2714 <strong>Combat system malfunctions</strong>\u2014power surges, failing dispensers, will test you.  <br>\u2714 <strong>Endure the Overseer\u2019s relentless judgment</strong>\u2014its criteria are unknown, its patience is not infinite.  <br>\u2714 <strong>Uncover the hidden purpose of the lab</strong>\u2014and your own existence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Test Hard to Pass</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you carry out your task, something <strong>deeper stirs within the facility</strong>. <strong>The unseen presence behind the Overseer grows aware of you.</strong> A voice\u2014distorted, ancient\u2014seeps into the system. Is it watching through the Overseer? Or has it always been there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>a relentless, suffocating atmosphere</strong>, <i>The Hatchling</i> is a test of your efficiency, endurance, and obedience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were built for this.</strong> But will you prove yourself worthy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <i>Wishlist now before the Overseer decides your fate.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Termination Protocol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505940/f8a01e36303de2cca927730d9a4ee3113d71bfe1.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505940/ddcf9ae999b920d63cb27b1d8a5a04871ba63b94.jpg"},{"name":"The Hatchling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505940/1fbc1c16ff0b0ca47633d1268d0b067405a859c2.jpg"},{"name":"Pro Caretaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505940/b9c5800f52fe49065dafe63c2a3c345921f4ded6.jpg"},{"name":"Well Done Caretaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505940/fcd58b36881dcad5f3d36525c8515191afd334c2.jpg"},{"name":"All Shall Serve","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505940/625ecd69724e3c2a85443bb94e6ae84e7662b83a.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505940?t=1762966791","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.stea