<strong>absolute efficiency</strong>:  <br>\u2714 <strong>Regulate temperature, humidity, and nutrients</strong>\u2014maintain the egg\u2019s <strong>delicate balance</strong>.  <br>\u2714 <strong>Acquire and ration lab supplies</strong> through the <strong>Supply Shaft</strong>\u2014resources are limited.  <br>\u2714 <strong>Combat system malfunctions</strong>\u2014power surges, failing dispensers, will test you.  <br>\u2714 <strong>Endure the Overseer\u2019s relentless judgment</strong>\u2014its criteria are unknown, its patience is not infinite.  <br>\u2714 <strong>Uncover the hidden purpose of the lab</strong>\u2014and your own existence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Test Hard to Pass</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you carry out your task, something <strong>deeper stirs within the facility</strong>. <strong>The unseen presence behind the Overseer grows aware of you.</strong> A voice\u2014distorted, ancient\u2014seeps into the system. Is it watching through the Overseer? Or has it always been there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>a relentless, suffocating atmosphere</strong>, <i>The Hatchling</i> is a test of your efficiency, endurance, and obedience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were built for this.</strong> But will you prove yourself worthy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <i>Wishlist now before the Overseer decides your fate.</i></p>","developers":["Ricardo Pratas"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505940/header.jpg?t=1762966791","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul